{"version":1,"content":"<p>坦白講，淨係靠拍寫真嚟搵食，即使作品大賣，收入多極有限，所以絕大部分寫真女優都會借助自身人氣，試圖踩入演藝界。</p><p>至於今日同大家見面嘅高挑美人石橋照美，同樣身兼多職，以女護士身份喺鏡頭前展現個人魅力。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.559408+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.619984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.619984+00:00","content_hash":"e9d9dbc103457a943d93a0b230001093e495bea1fb25957b1d709ccbb5e4601e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}